 ]\\\\n}\\\"\\n}\\n###CALL_RESULTS-2025-07-26T17:42:03.637Z###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###recruit_impl###\\nSYSTEM CALL\\nType: RECRUIT\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"justification\\\": \\\"We need a senior technical lead to plan and execute the full WordPress-based implementation (hosting setup, SSL, theme/plugins, authentication workflow, security hardening, backups) in a cost-efficient, user-friendly manner.\\\",\\n  \\\"title\\\": \\\"Director of Web Implementation\\\",\\n  \\\"customSystemInstructions\\\": \\\"You own the end-to-end technical build of the HOA website: choose hosting, install/configure WordPress, set up plugins for member self-registration with admin approval, restrict specified pages, enforce security best practices, automate backups, and document everything so a non-technical administrator can maintain the site.\\\"\\n}\\n###recruit_impl###\\n###recruit_design###\\nSYSTEM CALL\\nType: RECRUIT\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"justification\\\": \\\"We need a high-level design/content strategist to craft a simple, professional look, build intuitive navigation, and ensure the CMS editing experience is painless for a non-technical user.\\\",\\n  \\\"title\\\": \\\"Director of Design & Content Strategy\\\",\\n  \\\"customSystemInstructions\\\": \\\"Create the visual style (colors, typography, layout) and WordPress theme configuration that delivers a clean, professional experience. Define page templates, menus, and a streamlined editor workflow so the HOA admin can easily add News & Events, upload documents, and manage content without knowing code.\\\"\\n}\\n###recruit_design###\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###CALL_RESULTS-2025-07-26T17:43:00.040Z###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Operations Department, System Call Directorate\\nTo: 1\\nType: Call Results\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"result\\\": \\\"{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"results\\\\\\\": [\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"callID\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"recruit_impl\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"SUCCESS